                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "info",
                    "props": {
                      "body": "Click Recalculate to run this analysis for HuRI, BioPlex, TAGC_binary2025, huMAP2_0.05, huMAP2_0.95, huMAP3_0.05, huMAP3_0.95."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "expander",
                    "props": {
                      "label": "Coverage population and interpretation",
                      "expanded": false,
                      "type": "default"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "markdown",
                        "props": {
                          "body": "The denominator is every mapped accession in the selected Curated protein set, including accessions absent from a network. A merged node may represent several accessions: accession coverage counts each covered accession, while node counts count each merged graph node once. The background consists of all network nodes with no selected accession. Mean degree is 2E/N and density is 2E/[N(N−1)] for the retained undirected graph. These are descriptive statistics; no hypothesis test or significance stars apply."
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
